#\#CIF_1.1
# Rock salt, NaCl. Hand-written test fixture from the published cell
# parameter (a = 5.6402 Å) and the Fm-3m general positions of the
# International Tables. The bibliography, reflection loop and second data
# block are padding that ReShiki must read past and drop.
